OL,3,AAnger as human poo and
OL,4,A'maggot-infested' food left behind at
OL,5,Abeauty spot
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt described the incident, near Llyn y
OL,8,FFan Fawr in the west of the park, as
OL,9,F"one of the worst" it had seen,
OL,10,Ffollowing on from long-running
OL,11,Fwildfires in the area.
